# ============================================================
# SignalFinding 動作確認用サンプルログ
# 目的:
# - IPごとのSignalFinding時系列表示確認
# - 同一IPで複数windowが出るか確認
# - count系 / ratio系 の複数window対応確認
# ============================================================

# ------------------------------
# 10.0.0.1
# → /login 200 の短時間連続アクセス
# 期待SignalFinding:
#   repeated_login @ 10:00:00-10:00:20
#   burst_access   @ 10:00:00-10:00:20
# 注意:
#   failed_login_count は出ない
#   high_failure_rate は出ない
# ------------------------------
2026-05-01T10:00:00 10.0.0.1 GET /login 200
2026-05-01T10:00:05 10.0.0.1 GET /login 200
2026-05-01T10:00:10 10.0.0.1 GET /login 200
2026-05-01T10:00:15 10.0.0.1 GET /login 200
2026-05-01T10:00:20 10.0.0.1 GET /login 200


# ------------------------------
# 10.0.0.2
# → 通常アクセス（時間間隔あり）
# 期待SignalFinding:
#   なし
# ------------------------------
2026-05-01T10:00:00 10.0.0.2 GET /home 200
2026-05-01T10:01:01 10.0.0.2 GET /home 200
2026-05-01T10:02:02 10.0.0.2 GET /home 200
2026-05-01T10:03:03 10.0.0.2 GET /home 200


