# 10.0.0.3
# → 短時間で複数404
# 期待SignalFinding:
#   many_404     @ 10:20:00-10:20:20
#   burst_access @ 10:20:00-10:20:20
# 注意:
#   repeated_login は出ない
# ------------------------------
2026-05-01T10:20:00 10.0.0.3 GET /aaa 404
2026-05-01T10:20:05 10.0.0.3 GET /bbb 404
2026-05-01T10:20:10 10.0.0.3 GET /ccc 404
2026-05-01T10:20:15 10.0.0.3 GET /ddd 404
2026-05-01T10:20:20 10.0.0.3 GET /eee 404


# ------------------------------
# 10.0.0.4
# → ログイン失敗の連続 1回目
# 期待SignalFinding:
#   repeated_login      @ 11:00:00-11:00:20
#   failed_login_count  @ 11:00:00-11:00:20
#   high_failure_rate   @ 11:00:00-11:00:20
#   burst_access        @ 11:00:00-11:00:20
